      "texto": "                  MONITORING TRUSTEE\n                  IN CASE M10687 - D’IETEREN / PHE\n\n\n\nOn 3 August 2022 the Commission approved the appointment of:\n\n\nAdvolis SAS\n38, Avenue de l'Opéra\n75002 Paris\nFrance\n\nContact: Antoni Vassileff\navassileff@advolis-orfis.com\n\n\n\nas Monitoring Trustee in the above-mentioned case.\n\n\n\nThe role of the Monitoring Trustee is to monitor the compliance of D’Ieteren Group with the\nCommitments attached to the Commission's Decision of 2 August 2022 and to report to the\nCommission thereon.\n\nThird parties who have queries in relation to the Commitments may contact the Trustee through\nthe above contact details.\n\nThe  foregoing  is  without  prejudice  to  the  Commission's  jurisdiction  to  oversee  the\nimplementation of the Commitments attached to its Decision.",
